      "subject": "feat(executive): Mission, Planning, Agent and Execution sections read Runtime missions (MS-5, ADR-0044)",
      "body": "Implements ADR-0044 Decision 6 and the MS-5 ticket. The four sections, the dashboard's mission health and current mission, and the command deck's current mission now read Runtime mission records; their design-preview data is removed. The owner records evidence where it is shown: task done, dropped with a reason, or reopened in Planning, and npm run build passed or failed for the exact recovery-anchor commit in Execution; Runtime then validates and completes (MS-4). Agents show only what exists: the live Chief Agent and the Mission System's six specialists as Not built. Approval cards name the mission a proposal decides. Presentation of the four sections certified after owner visual approval.\n\nMission: MS-2026-0001\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AHtXdN7VRusNxTFHzk5uFe",
